    "footer.html" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "nb" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "<b>Værdata fra <a href=\"https://open-meteo.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open-Meteo.com</a></b> (<a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CC BY 4.0</a>; modellene ECMWF, NOAA GFS, DWD ICON, GEM, Météo-France, UKMO, JMA, CMA, BOM, KNMI, DMI, MET Norway) og <b><a href=\"https://api.met.no/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Meteorologisk institutt</a></b> (CC BY 4.0). Historikk og etterprøving: ERA5 / Copernicus-reanalyse via Open-Meteo. Observasjoner: METAR-rapporter via NOAA Aviation Weather Center. Kart: <a href=\"https://www.kartverket.no/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">© Kartverket</a> (CC BY 4.0) og <a href=\"https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">© OpenStreetMap-bidragsytere</a>; stedsnavn © OpenStreetMap-bidragsytere (Nominatim). «Målt nå i nærheten» bygger på offentlig delte private værstasjoner fra <a href=\"https://weathermap.netatmo.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Netatmo</a>.<br>Sannsynlighetene viser hvor enige modellene er og er <b>ikke et offisielt varsel</b> – bruk dem aldri der sikkerhet står på spill. Gratis, uten reklame, uten konto. Basert på <a href=\"https://github.com/santonoreg/weather_forecast\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">WeFo</a> av santonoreg. <a href=\"privacy.html\">Personvern</a> Figur i skyggekartet: <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Man_Waving_Hand_GIF_Animation_Loop_(large).gif\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Videoplasty.com / Wikimedia Commons</a> (<a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CC BY-SA 4.0</a>, nedskalert)."
          }
        },
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "<b>Weather data by <a href=\"https://open-meteo.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open-Meteo.com</a></b> (<a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CC BY 4.0</a>; ECMWF, NOAA GFS, DWD ICON, GEM, Météo-France, UKMO, JMA, CMA, BOM, KNMI, DMI, MET Norway models) and <b><a href=\"https://api.met.no/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">MET Norway</a></b> (CC BY 4.0). History and verification: ERA5 / Copernicus reanalysis via Open-Meteo. Observations: METAR reports via the NOAA Aviation Weather Center. Map: <a href=\"https://www.kartverket.no/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">© Kartverket</a> (CC BY 4.0) and <a href=\"https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">© OpenStreetMap contributors</a>; place names © OpenStreetMap contributors (Nominatim). \"Measured nearby\" uses publicly shared private weather stations from <a href=\"https://weathermap.netatmo.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Netatmo</a>.<br>The probabilities reflect the agreement between models and are <b>not an official forecast</b> – never use them for safety-critical decisions. Free, no ads, no accounts. Based on <a href=\"https://github.com/santonoreg/weather_forecast\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">WeFo</a> by santonoreg. <a href=\"privacy.html\">Privacy</a> Figure in the shadow map: <a href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Man_Waving_Hand_GIF_Animation_Loop_(large).gif\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Videoplasty.com / Wikimedia Commons</a> (<a href=\"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">CC BY-SA 4.0</a>, scaled down)."
          }
        }
      },
      "comment" : "HTML: render with L10n.attributed(key) or L10n.stripped(key), not as plain text."
    },
