          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Trails, places and heights: © Kartverket (Turrutebasen, place names, elevation data, CC BY 4.0). Forest and tractor roads: © OpenStreetMap contributors (ODbL). Weather: Open-Meteo (MET Nordic, DMI HARMONIE and others), warnings, fog and thunder probability: MET Norway. Walking time by DNT's rule of thumb."
